  "description": "Immerse yourself in the enchanting allure of digital paper sporting a timeless, vintage comic flair, all encapsulated in a remarkable resolution of 2480×3508 px. This graphic offering, aptly named ‘6 Vintage Comic Stripes Papers A4’, is the perfect embellishment for creations that yearn for a touch of nostalgia. With dimensions designed perfect for A4 applications and a high resolution of 300 dpi, the image files are perfect for bringing your designs to life in RGB color.\nThese high-resolution graphics in JPG and PNG formats add an element of charm to a myriad of physical products. They breathe life into cards, framed artworks, children’s crafts, scrapbooks, tees, pillows, bags, mugs, stickers, and countless more. The vibrant, colored images are print-ready and waiting to be harnessed for your creative whims.\nKindly note that a computer will be required to unzip these files and a design/editing program that supports JPG/PNG file formats will be essential to use them effectively. Please be aware that this is a digital download; no physical items will be shipped.\nPlease note that the colours may vary slightly from the on-screen display to the actual print. We appreciate your purchase and trust that you will find joy in utilizing our images. Rest assured that your downloaded files will be free from watermarks. As per policy, these Digital Image Files should not be copied, distributed, modified, shared, or resold.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Immerse yourself in the enchanting allure of digital paper sporting a timeless, vintage comic flair, all encapsulated in a remarkable resolution of 2480×3508 px. This graphic offering, aptly named ‘6 Vintage Comic Stripes Papers A4’, is the perfect embellishment for creations that yearn for a touch of nostalgia. With dimensions designed perfect for A4 applications and a high resolution of 300 dpi, the image files are perfect for bringing your designs to life in RGB color.</p>\n<p>These high-resolution graphics in JPG and PNG formats add an element of charm to a myriad of physical products. They breathe life into cards, framed artworks, children’s crafts, scrapbooks, tees, pillows, bags, mugs, stickers, and countless more. The vibrant, colored images are print-ready and waiting to be harnessed for your creative whims.</p>\n<p>Kindly note that a computer will be required to unzip these files and a design/editing program that supports JPG/PNG file formats will be essential to use them effectively. Please be aware that this is a digital download; no physical items will be shipped.</p>\n<p>Please note that the colours may vary slightly from the on-screen display to the actual print. We appreciate your purchase and trust that you will find joy in utilizing our images. Rest assured that your downloaded files will be free from watermarks. As per policy, these Digital Image Files should not be copied, distributed, modified, shared, or resold.</p>",
